    {
      "id": "kpk1-l06-g-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l06-g-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dictionary forms"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A dictionary lists a verb in its dictionary form: *idę* is from *iść*, *mam* from *mieć*, *chcę* from *chcieć*, *mogę* from *móc*, *muszę* from *musieć*, *piszę* from *pisać*, *trenuję* from *trenować*. Its *ja* and *ty* forms show its conjugation: *znam, znasz* (*-m, -sz*); *piszę, piszesz* (*-ę, -esz*); *robię, robisz* (*-ę, -isz*)."
      }
    }
  ],
